# Cloudflare Pages redirects for TETE
# Proxy API requests and markdown files to backend server

# Static markdown files (must be before /*)
/README.md https://tetein.apipedia.id/README.md 200
/AGENT.md https://tetein.apipedia.id/AGENT.md 200
/api.md https://tetein.apipedia.id/api.md 200

# API endpoints
/api/* https://tetein.apipedia.id/api/:splat 200

# All other requests serve from Cloudflare Pages
/* /index.html 200
